 ok(f'# Preserve failure point and measured allocated/reserved peaks.\n# Allocation reference: weights 20*10*4, bias 10*4 => {param} bytes;\n# add gradients, activations and batch matrices at their own element widths\n# only where simultaneously live at failure.\n# Diagnosis: unnecessary saved graph-connected losses retain graph memory.\n# Single change: save loss.item() instead of the loss tensor.\n# Same bounded rerun completes within the supplied memory requirement;\n# retain corrected allocated and reserved peaks alongside failed peaks.', 'The report distinguishes allocated/reserved evidence, accounts for simultaneous allocations and verifies one supported retention correction against the same task.'),
